      ],
      "image": "assets/images/261641/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease a rimmed baking sheet with 2 teaspoons coconut oil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk almond flour, salt, and baking soda together in a bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3ka5Q8qsZcWVRFrfGdiN-kOQjmc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/Whole30BananaBreadDropMuffinsRecipe_261641_step2_0018-f1c3cdd67dd94480ba3140edcaa8c5cc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/261641/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Break bananas into pieces and place into a microwave-safe bowl. Microwave until soft, about 30 seconds.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/j2UwFK3BPCYmRYDI15R9Wj4_tf8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/Whole30BananaBreadDropMuffinsRecipe_261641_step3_0019-6a622bf9001e47dc9ac3e854546b94d9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/261641/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mash bananas until creamy. Add 1/4 cup melted coconut oil and eggs; mix until well combined. Stir in dry ingredients until incorporated.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/PbmjDqKdxBq_PH-9MwgrZmDtxGw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/Whole30BananaBreadDropMuffinsRecipe_261641_step4_0022-2c73f589da6240868d376be63429b428.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/261641/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drop batter onto the prepared baking sheet, making 12 biscuit-shaped mounds.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/SxHFTSiZ-ikAjBbdX7xOns8gUmI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/Whole30BananaBreadDropMuffinsRecipe_261641_step5_0024-8df28e12499548f782e97d5dc022f1de.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/261641/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until peaks are lightly browned, about 17 minutes. Remove from the oven and allow to cool slightly before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
